msgstr "ありがとうございました。"

msgid "This release wouldn't have happened without the broader Quarkus ecosystem — the maintainers, contributors, and community that make building extensions like this possible. We are also grateful to the https://www.cncf.io/[CNCF] for hosting the https://open-workflow-specification.org/[Open Workflow Specification] project, which Quarkus Flow is built upon."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you want to get involved, the project is on https://github.com/quarkiverse/quarkus-flow[GitHub] and we welcome issues, discussions, and pull requests."
msgstr ""
